  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young Entrepreneurs Week</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &apos;Semaine des jeunes entrepreneurs&apos; (Young Entrepreneurs Week) is an annual event to promote youth entrepreneurship in Chad. During this activity, conferences, workshops, networking sessions, competitions and mentoring activities are organized to inspire, train, raise awareness and support young entrepreneurs in the development of their business/project. This week offers opportunities for young entrepreneurs to network and share experiences, enabling them to exchange ideas, learn and develop their professional networks. Entrepreneurs will have the opportunity to present their products and services, and to follow a series of training courses that will enable them to develop their businesses. A pitch contest will be organized to select entrepreneurs for a follow-up trajectory of personalized training and coaching.</narrative>
  </description>
